{"game": "palworld", "language": "english", "appid": 1623730, "month": "2025-04", "window": 4, "start_date": 1745366400, "end_date": 1746057599, "month_true_total": 1270, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 16:58:41 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "193937300", "author": {"steamid": "76561199203590369", "personaname": "Ko_Rnnn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199203590369/", "num_games_owned": 19, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 4213, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1820, "last_played": 1786318380, "avatar": "abc4a78f5396fb9625d11ec123c472a48848955b"}, "language": "english", "review": "I recommend this game to players because genuinely it is a good game, but I have problems with it that could just be user error, but I am not sure. \r\n\r\nI have had this game since it came out. after a few months, I couldn't join any of my saves without the crash error popping up. Recently, I have been able to play but as of right now, I cannot. The crash error pops up. I've checked my mods so it cant be that considering I also haven't downloaded any. Please somebody lmk if this is a me issue or if this happens to anyone else.", "timestamp_created": 1746054870, "timestamp_updated": 1746054870, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193936192", "author": {"steamid": "76561197991944905", "personaname": "RWX Studio", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197991944905/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 36331, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 491, "playtime_at_review": 17386, "last_played": 1790647462, "avatar": "d2b0afa257f1cc0da32d5985e5a7b3a2a90d2d15"}, "language": "english", "review": "[h1]A great game with many mechanics[/h1]\r\nArk: Survival Evolved meets Monster Rancher. Survival, base building and capturing monsters while fighting other \"gangs\" as the story progresses. Sure, there are bugs that need ironing out still, like path-finding for your Pals, but the sheer amount of content is crazy for an early access title still in development. All of those saying this game is just \"Pokemon with guns\" are only scratching the surface of everything you can do in this game. I also appreciate the fact that the developers added into the settings the ability to mod how the game plays ny tweaking values to say, increase XP gained, or the number of Pals spawning.", "timestamp_created": 1746053308, "timestamp_updated": 1746053308, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193932358", "author": {"steamid": "76561198138546052", "personaname": "JollySparrow", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198138546052/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 62281, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 57538, "last_played": 1784046740, "avatar": "ee5cc428258a2f7f5775ae66f8bbcde744738e44"}, "language": "english", "review": "The pals yearn for the mines.\n\ngame very fun, beautiful world. Highly recommend.", "timestamp_created": 1746048540, "timestamp_updated": 1746048540, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "19